\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Moe Bogan enters
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 One Jones finds a Moe Bogan podcast while researching something genuine.\u8232 He does not become a fan immediately.\u8232 He listens because Bogan claims to expose suppressed information.\u8232 A second Jones listens to verify the first Jones.\u8232 A third checks Bogan's sources.\u8232 Something Bogan says accidentally overlaps with a real event.\u8232 The Joneses begin taking him seriously for all the wrong reasons.\u8232 Their intelligence station develops a 
\f5\b Grand Unified Conspiracy Theory
\f4\b0 .\uc0\u8232 Raw material for the theory:\u8232 
\f5\b Grayling Corporation
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 Mass-produced Elvi and Ajent Joneses are not consumer products but components of an abandoned population-control program.\u8232 
\f5\b Tie colours
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 Red, green, black and pink ties identify operational phases, command strata, sleeper classes or contamination states.\u8232 The fact they were really marketing variants only makes the Joneses more certain that marketing was the cover.\u8232 
\f5\b Harum Scarum
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 The complete absence of Harum Scarum stock from Jamison Hardy's bunker proves somebody removed it.\u8232 It cannot merely mean Hardy never bought any.\u8232 
\f5\b The Holy Momma
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 Sarah's pregnancy sits at the intersection of too many unrelated events to be unrelated.\u8232 
\f5\b Chanta
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 Chanta's increasing exclusion from Elvi affairs may be evidence that somebody deliberately wants the Great Teacher isolated.\u8232 Chanta may find this particular conclusion interesting.\u8232 
\f5\b The High Elvis
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 The replacement High Elvis taking independent action may indicate infiltration, succession planning, strategic distancing or an attempt to deny Chanta operational control.\u8232 
\f5\b PAPER
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 Clearly part of it.\u8232 Nobody needs to specify which part.\u8232 
\f5\b Gerry Hardman
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 His repeated presence around major events is statistically suspicious.\u8232 This can begin laying track towards the later Gerry/Jihad Man material.\u8232 
\f5\b Fridge Force
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 Any organisation that claims to regulate preservation technology while possessing secret knowledge of Gyges discs obviously has another purpose.\u8232 This happens to be largely true.\u8232 
\f5\b Shakti
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 Eloise Shakti has too much technology, too much secrecy and too many connections for the absence of evidence to mean anything except extremely competent evidence removal.\u8232 
\f5\b The Sages
\f4\b0 \uc0\u8232 Nobody knows what they are, which the Joneses regard as particularly conclusive.\u8232 Their final model should be mostly wrong in its connections while containing an embarrassing amount of correct data.\
\ls2\ilvl0
